start=\"485\" data-end=\"514\">ru\u010dn\u00edch Ramanov\u00fdch analyz\u00e1tor\u016f<\/strong> a <strong data-start=\"517\" data-end=\"561\"><a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/produkt\/nicolet-summit\/\">laboratorn\u00edch FT-IR<\/a> a <a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/produkt\/nicolet-is50\/\">FT-Raman spektrometr\u016f<\/a><\/strong> zrychluje a zp\u0159es\u0148uje identifikaci kontrolovan\u00fdch l\u00e1tek.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"26zyld\" data-start=\"633\" data-end=\"670\">\ud83d\udd0d <strong data-start=\"640\" data-end=\"670\">Co se na webin\u00e1\u0159i dozv\u00edte?<\/strong><\/h3>\n<ul>\n<li data-start=\"674\" data-end=\"841\"><strong data-start=\"674\" data-end=\"706\">Identifikace p\u0159\u00edmo na m\u00edst\u011b:<\/strong> Jak ru\u010dn\u00ed Ramanovy spektrometry detekuj\u00ed \u0161irok\u00e9 spektrum l\u00e1tek \u2013 od analog\u016f fentanylu po prekurzory a \u0159edidla.<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"847\" data-end=\"994\"><strong data-start=\"847\" data-end=\"874\">Potvrzen\u00ed v laborato\u0159i:<\/strong> Jak lze <strong data-start=\"883\" data-end=\"902\"><a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/produkt\/nicolet-summit\/\">FT-IR<\/a> a <a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/produkt\/nicolet-is50\/\">FT-Raman<\/a><\/strong> p\u0159\u00edstroje efektivn\u011b vyu\u017e\u00edt k potvrzen\u00ed v\u00fdsledk\u016f z ter\u00e9nu s vysokou p\u0159esnost\u00ed a bezpe\u010dnost\u00ed.<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"998\" data-end=\"1183\"><strong data-start=\"998\" data-end=\"1033\">Spektr\u00e1ln\u00ed knihovna narkotik:<\/strong> Nahl\u00e9dn\u011bte do rozs\u00e1hl\u00e9 a neust\u00e1le aktualizovan\u00e9 datab\u00e1ze referen\u010dn\u00edch spekter, kter\u00e1 umo\u017e\u0148uje jednozna\u010dnou klasifikaci i v p\u0159\u00edpadech slo\u017eit\u00fdch sm\u011bs\u00ed.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"nmszwu\" data-start=\"1190\" data-end=\"1227\">\ud83d\udc65 <strong data-start=\"1197\" data-end=\"1227\">Pro koho je webin\u00e1\u0159 ur\u010den?<\/strong><\/h3